      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "…was sent, if not again the same Lord, the Savior Christ? Moreover, it was also [shown] here earlier about the Holy Spirit, about his divinity:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s19",
      "source_sha256": "51c08d9014b9d1ed",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and that"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s20",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s21",
      "source_sha256": "c67ac85f880bb977",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "is the Spirit of God, as Job said: \"The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s22",
      "source_sha256": "6b17da0fa9f4340c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made me, and the breath of the Almighty gave me life.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s23",
      "source_sha256": "6fc2801e9d31a336",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "\"Behold, God himself made me just as he made you.\" Concerning the same one of whom he had indeed said earlier: \"The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s24",
      "source_sha256": "ff63d725e7251ffc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made me.\" That he then joined"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s25",
      "source_sha256": "915d5cfd4c38391b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "to God, where he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s26",
      "source_sha256": "9b408df0a8dbd3cd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "afterwards said: \"Behold, God made me just as he made you,\" so that he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s27",
      "source_sha256": "13cd45f77501fc5e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made known that this same Spirit is God. Here it speaks of the indication of the three persons of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s28",
      "source_sha256": "96320d6fcbaf5a07",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "It is shown"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s29",
      "source_sha256": "3c88d080dbca2179",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "in the books of the Old Testament that the Father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s30",
      "source_sha256": "ff4e4bd9f286647c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and the Son and the Holy Spirit are God. Yet the Jewish people do not believe this, that the Son and the Holy Spirit are God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s1",
      "source_sha256": "556c38c2dec3db01",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and will be"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s2",
      "source_sha256": "e89a2fb74b024c1b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "name"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4b1dab3229477d54",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "called"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s4",
      "source_sha256": "780e90ee5b5a6c92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s5",
      "source_sha256": "09caa4e0fecef498",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "of the age to come"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s6",
      "source_sha256": "8c99bd9e96235d4d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "his rule will be multiplied"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s7",
      "source_sha256": "a48253b6cd9145f5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "The prophet indeed [said] \"was born\": not born for himself when he became man, [but] born for us. \"Son,\" moreover,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s8",
      "source_sha256": "d4fb42afdcb6e14c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "if not the Son of God? \"His lordship [is upon his shoulder]\" because [?] on his own [?], because Pilate wrote the title of his [?] above his head."
    }
  ]
